The entire proof is the contraction $\sum_bU^\dagger_{b''b}U_{bb'}
=(U^\dagger U)_{b''b'}
=\delta_{b''b'}.$ No factorization assumption was used. Equation [eq:l8-locality-proof] holds whether the joint state is a product or is maximally entangled. Thus every Alice-only expectation value, $\expect{L_A}
=
\operatorname{Tr}_A(\rho_A L_A),$ is invariant under Bob’s local unitary.

