Replace the basis labels by positions and the sum by an integral: $\braket{\psi}{\phi}
=
\int_{-\infty}^{\infty}\psi^*(x)\phi(x)\,dx.$ Interchanging the vectors complex conjugates the answer, $\braket{\phi}{\psi}
=
\braket{\psi}{\phi}^*,$ and the norm is $\|\psi\|^2=\braket{\psi}{\psi}
=\int |\psi(x)|^2\,dx.$

